      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy is prepared by vacuum arc melting.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention adds approximately 0.1 at% B to the base EHEA.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The B-modified and baseline alloys are homogenized at approximately 1100 °C for 24 hours and then rolled by roughly 50–70%.",
      "field": "intervention; conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermomechanical processing can refine an AlCoCrFeNi-based EHEA while retaining its duplex lamellar character.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9506522::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boron segregates to grain and lamellar boundaries in the proposed EHEA.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 0.1 at% B strengthens grain and lamellar boundaries in the proposed EHEA.",
      "field": "structural_mediator; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The minor B addition refines lamellar spacing.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boundary strengthening and lamellar refinement inhibit crack initiation and propagation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refined lamellae enhance dislocation trapping.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microcrack arrest in a thermomechanically processed AlCoCrFeNi-based EHEA can contribute to an improved mechanical response.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 0.1 at% B and applying the specified processing will increase yield strength relative to an identically processed B-free alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9506522::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 0.1 at% B and applying the specified processing will increase elongation to failure relative to an identically processed B-free alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
